WEBVTT

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:06.320
"Why do you dig?"

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:14.200
When legendary tunnel engineer Alejandro
Vedernikov was asked that question, he responded:

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:20.980
"Because a new world awaits on the other side."

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:31.420
I will get to that new world!

00:00:33.890 --> 00:00:37.760
Here I come, girls' locker room!

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:43.560
The girls' locker room!

00:00:47.310 --> 00:00:48.300
What's this?

00:02:22.310 --> 00:02:25.080
Here they are! Get 'em while they're hot!

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:28.460
Pictures from the field observation trip!

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:30.710
When did you take these, anyway?

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:35.380
Let's just say that I mix business with pleasure.

00:02:35.380 --> 00:02:37.550
I'll take one of Shrade!

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:38.720
Here you go.

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:40.920
Man, I look awful in this one.

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:43.880
Hey, here's a good one of you.

00:02:45.890 --> 00:02:48.520
Yep, this one's great.

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:50.600
Are you buying that one, Amata?

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:57.110
Wouldn't you rather have a real live girl instead of a picture?

00:03:00.510 --> 00:03:02.080
H-Hey!

00:03:03.890 --> 00:03:05.950
Amata, you really will fly for anyone!

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:08.080
No!

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:10.960
Um, go ahead and take it.

00:03:18.950 --> 00:03:21.700
They're all over you, stud.

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:23.520
Cut that out.

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:26.890
Can I have this photo?

00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:29.060
That one?

00:03:29.690 --> 00:03:32.660
I guess. That'll be 500 kowloons.

00:03:32.660 --> 00:03:33.600
Thanks.

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:36.260
Huh? Who's that of?

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:37.480
Um...

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:38.940
Just let me see!

00:03:39.670 --> 00:03:41.430
Amata?

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:43.540
Amata and Andy?

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:46.660
Who would've thought...

00:03:50.350 --> 00:03:52.170
Yo, my hole digging bro!

00:03:53.550 --> 00:03:55.920
You'll never guess what I just found!

00:03:58.490 --> 00:03:59.320
What?

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:09.430
Unless I'm very much mistaken, this is the Book of Twin Stars!

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:11.460
The Book of Twin Stars?

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:13.100
I've heard of it.

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:21.320
According to the legend, whoever holds that book can take full control of the forbidden Aquarion.

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:26.340
The green cat is right.

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:29.540
Neo-Deava has been looking for this thing ever since it was founded.

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:32.370
How did <i>you</i> find it, then?

00:04:32.690 --> 00:04:34.370
Yeah, where was it?

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:36.920
You see, I was digging a hole to—

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:40.880
On second thought, that's not important right now.

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:44.380
Chairman Crea!

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:47.800
Isn't it time you told us the truth?

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:50.080
What do you mean?

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:54.680
You must have found something important if you've already returned from your journey.

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:56.670
Important?

00:04:56.670 --> 00:04:58.810
Oh, I forgot!

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:01.190
This is for everyone to share.

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:03.220
That's not what we mean!

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:04.900
Don't you like it?

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:07.660
That's not the issue here!

00:05:08.150 --> 00:05:10.700
They cannot see it with their eyes.

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:14.960
The book will only open for eyes that cannot see.

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:19.840
So if the verb is conjugated like so...

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:23.580
R, ry... ribbit ribbit?

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:25.010
What does that mean?

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:29.510
Damn it. Why didn't I pay attention in lit class?

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:32.910
Dude, Amata, help me out here.

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:33.860
'Kay.

00:05:33.860 --> 00:05:39.960
Um, d... dig... digging?

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:48.610
I have to tell him I'm sorry.

00:05:50.610 --> 00:05:55.120
What does she need to apologize for?

00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:03.170
This is how it's done!

00:06:06.350 --> 00:06:08.130
What are you doing?

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:11.140
"Socks must be white!"

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:12.780
What?

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:15.560
It's the first line. He spent all night on it.

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:21.810
This is Chapter 23, verse 1 of the way to unlock Aquarion's full potential.

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:24.820
What do socks have to do with Aquarion?

00:06:25.910 --> 00:06:27.820
Well, this is just my theory, but...

00:06:28.430 --> 00:06:34.620
The wisdom of ancient wrestlers states that fighters who lost their shoes were at a disadvantage.

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:40.330
This shows us that feet play an important role in regulating our bodies.

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:45.590
The color of the cloth that wraps such an vital center of the body is a deep matter.

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:48.600
Cloth wrapping vital parts, you say?

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:52.640
It's got a teal border.

00:06:57.990 --> 00:07:00.180
Can you guess what color I'm wearing?

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:03.780
Come on, you guys, this is serious!

00:07:03.780 --> 00:07:05.800
We're talking about ancient documents here!

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:06.440
Huh?

00:07:09.810 --> 00:07:12.460
What do people see in her?

00:07:12.460 --> 00:07:14.160
What's this about ancient documents?

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:16.760
Andy says he found one.

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:19.870
Let me see it.

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:20.870
Here...

00:07:21.530 --> 00:07:23.200
Mix, can you read that?

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:24.960
Ancient literature is my thing.

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:26.690
Um...

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:29.630
"Top buttons must be buttoned."

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:30.630
What?

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:32.340
Top buttons?

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:35.220
"No hair that grows past the eyebrows."

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:36.350
Hair?

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:38.400
"No dyed hair."

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:41.320
"Skirts must reach at least 5cm below the knee."

00:07:41.320 --> 00:07:43.180
"No running in the halls."

00:07:43.180 --> 00:07:44.690
Wait, aren't these...

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:50.180
Ancient school rules. This could be some student's handbook.

00:07:53.630 --> 00:07:55.240
What's the matter with him?

00:08:06.010 --> 00:08:08.920
To find the most powerful Rare Igura,

00:08:09.690 --> 00:08:11.800
we must go to Vega once more.

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:18.240
We have found many Rare Iguras thus far,

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:24.300
but the dimensional transference has either killed them or made them useless to us.

00:08:27.050 --> 00:08:30.780
I'd be happy with just Alicia.

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:35.240
Jin, this regards the fate of all Altair.

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:44.220
At first, baby girls ceased being born on our planet.

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:50.680
Then, our women began dying due to an unknown disease.

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:55.220
Eventually, only men remained on Altair.

00:08:59.650 --> 00:09:02.860
This is not an invasion of Vega.

00:09:03.550 --> 00:09:06.480
We mean only to ensure the survival of our species.

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:15.080
We must find the most powerful Rare Igura, strong enough to survive interdimensional travel intact,

00:09:16.010 --> 00:09:20.740
and make her into our true Eve, the bride who will bear the next generation of Altair.

00:09:21.250 --> 00:09:26.500
There's a good chance that the strongest of the Rare Iguras pilots the Machine Angel.

00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:31.950
I understand, High Commander Izumo.

00:09:31.950 --> 00:09:35.910
I'll go down there myself this time instead of piloting by remote.

00:09:35.910 --> 00:09:37.720
Go, Jin,

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:41.600
last son of Altair.

00:09:44.630 --> 00:09:47.020
I'll dial up the optical sensors,

00:09:47.610 --> 00:09:51.940
and I'll focus on solid ammo so I don't end up like last time.

00:09:52.590 --> 00:09:55.680
Better take some infiltrator ammo, too.

00:09:55.680 --> 00:09:58.030
Add some heavy armor on top, and...

00:09:58.770 --> 00:10:01.780
I've made a perfect, flawless shield of iron.

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:06.370
Man, I made a total ass of myself.

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:11.630
I dunno. An ancient school handbook is a pretty big find in itself.

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:15.630
We can donate it to the Neo-Kowloon Museum!

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:19.380
Those old guys are anal about the smallest things.

00:10:19.380 --> 00:10:21.720
Rules for the length of your hair and skirt?

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:25.520
You're wrong! We can learn from the lessons of history!

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:30.480
Neo-Deava should follow the wisdom of the ancients and strengthen its own rules!

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:31.760
What?

00:10:32.370 --> 00:10:36.160
I've always thought that your clothes are too revealing, Zessica!

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:38.780
Have you not thought about guarding yourself from the gaze of those boys?

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:40.990
Really? You think so?

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:45.980
To begin with, what do you think the
scriptures say about showing your belly?

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:48.250
You may as well be walking around in just your underwear!

00:10:49.050 --> 00:10:50.420
Just her underwear...

00:10:52.390 --> 00:10:57.010
Let's try and fix what we can with a few quick rules.

00:10:57.010 --> 00:11:00.430
Zessica, there will be no more exposing yourself from now on!

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:04.140
You're treating me like some kind of creep!

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:07.180
Amata, do you think it's bad that you can see my belly?

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:10.850
Well, I mean, not your...

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:19.320
Never have to guess what he's thinking.

00:11:42.770 --> 00:11:44.390
Shush?

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:50.000
Do you think guys like girls who wear flashy clothes?

00:11:51.530 --> 00:11:54.690
Oh, so you <i>do </i>have clothes like that.

00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:56.190
Zessica!

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:57.500
Let me see.

00:11:59.630 --> 00:12:01.940
You could show off more.

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:03.360
I think this would look good on you.

00:12:05.070 --> 00:12:07.120
I'm not like you!

00:12:09.310 --> 00:12:11.710
Abductors detected in the Neo-Kowloon area.

00:12:19.030 --> 00:12:21.920
Come and get me, Machine Angel.

00:12:22.490 --> 00:12:25.430
He'll start attacking Neo-Kowloon if we make him wait.

00:12:25.810 --> 00:12:28.980
He's not here to abduct people this time.

00:12:28.980 --> 00:12:32.430
Fudo, what do you think their goal is?

00:12:33.030 --> 00:12:36.060
Heavy Armor Radius Gniss.

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:39.630
Send out Aquarion!

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:43.070
The head is Amata! With Zessica and Mikono!

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:43.740
Mikono?

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:44.740
But she...

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:46.880
I... I can't!

00:12:47.390 --> 00:12:48.480
Here I go!

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:07.640
Vector Z, launching!

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:11.270
Vector Y, launching!

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:14.940
Vector X, launching!

00:13:28.690 --> 00:13:30.870
Approaching the enemy Abductor!

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:32.620
Get ready, Mikono!

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:38.920
Defensive Union! Go, Aquarion!

00:13:52.070 --> 00:13:54.560
Aquarion Evol!

00:13:56.390 --> 00:13:58.900
W-What should I do?

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:00.620
Mikono...

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:04.200
This ends right here, Abductor!

00:14:06.550 --> 00:14:08.860
Infinity Punch!

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:17.580
He's tough!

00:14:17.950 --> 00:14:21.080
You hit me with that before.

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:22.540
I'm not falling for the same thing again.

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:32.800
These are the Rare Iguras?

00:14:33.110 --> 00:14:36.730
Pff. They're light years below Silvie.

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:40.730
Stop it, Jin! Get back here!

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:44.400
Keep your hands off her! That's my wench!

00:14:49.310 --> 00:14:51.820
Your voice is so ugly.

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:54.580
I know you can cry out more beautifully.

00:14:54.890 --> 00:14:59.850
Feel the jealousy, Kagura. Feel it more.

00:14:59.850 --> 00:15:03.130
Feel the pain of having the one you love stolen away.

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:05.840
Drink it deeply.

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:16.850
Let's see how powerful you Rare Iguras are.

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:36.290
No damage to Aquarion's external armor!

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:38.620
But it's having an effect on the Elements!

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:41.120
He's using infiltrator ammunition?

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:47.380
He's creating shockwaves that resonate through
Aquarion, thus dealing damage directly within it...

00:16:00.630 --> 00:16:01.640
Mikono!

00:16:02.050 --> 00:16:03.810
Their Union rate is plummeting rapidly!

00:16:04.130 --> 00:16:05.810
The Union is breaking!

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:22.250
Don't look away. Watch closely.

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:26.760
Jin is violating your very own Rare Igura.

00:16:27.370 --> 00:16:28.460
Stop!

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:30.710
Stop it!

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:38.060
Pathetic.

00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:41.890
There's no way one of those weaklings could possibly be our true Eve.

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:44.600
The Element suits have been heavily damaged!

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:48.440
We have to do something, or else the shock is going to go right to their bodies!

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:49.400
Mikono!

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:51.580
I can't watch this!

00:16:51.580 --> 00:16:52.740
Switch me in!

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:55.060
Let me go, High Commander!

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:57.070
Zessica, dodge it!

00:17:17.810 --> 00:17:18.840
What just happened?

00:17:24.970 --> 00:17:26.830
I can feel the missiles in the air!

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:28.900
I felt them on my skin!

00:17:32.050 --> 00:17:33.610
How is Zessica's machine doing that?

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:36.610
Fudo, what does this mean?

00:17:37.750 --> 00:17:42.220
As people get naked, their senses get sharper.

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:46.000
Rip off your clothes. Let down your guard,

00:17:46.510 --> 00:17:50.860
and you will sense your enemy's moves with perfect precision.

00:17:50.860 --> 00:17:54.670
So the less I'm wearing, the better I'll be able to dodge?

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:57.260
But we can't possibly do that!

00:17:58.190 --> 00:18:00.100
This isn't the time to be modest!

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:08.620
Zessica!

00:18:12.710 --> 00:18:13.940
I can do it, too!

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:26.000
Mikono, not you, too!

00:18:26.570 --> 00:18:28.830
Mikono and Zessica's mind levels are rising!

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:30.830
They're at a Union-capable level!

00:18:31.330 --> 00:18:33.760
Right now! Unite!

00:18:33.760 --> 00:18:35.340
The head is Zessica Wong!

00:18:36.350 --> 00:18:40.090
Unguarded Union! Go, Aquarion!

00:18:52.510 --> 00:18:55.280
My skin feels so sensitive...

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:57.190
I can feel it all over my body...

00:18:57.510 --> 00:18:59.530
So intense!

00:19:03.050 --> 00:19:05.710
Aquarion Spada!

00:19:09.630 --> 00:19:12.860
I can feel Amata looking at me...

00:19:13.410 --> 00:19:14.500
I'm so embarrassed!

00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:17.050
Mikono's mind level is still rising!

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:18.600
But why?

00:19:18.600 --> 00:19:22.180
She knows someone is looking at her, so her body is hot and bothered.

00:19:22.180 --> 00:19:23.180
I understand.

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:29.480
It's okay. You don't have to be embarrassed.

00:19:32.010 --> 00:19:34.820
Doesn't matter if you've United.

00:19:34.820 --> 00:19:36.690
Just admit defeat already!

00:19:39.310 --> 00:19:40.110
Here they come!

00:19:42.730 --> 00:19:44.870
My senses are incredibly keen now...

00:19:46.710 --> 00:19:48.790
I can feel them all perfectly!

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:57.420
They dodged?

00:20:02.090 --> 00:20:05.300
More!

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:09.810
Zessica's spirit level is at an all-time high!

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:11.730
I'll do it too!

00:20:12.730 --> 00:20:15.500
I'm embarrassed... but...!

00:20:20.190 --> 00:20:22.530
Their sonata is so powerful

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:25.640
that I can't possibly play it.

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:36.170
A heart-pounding battle unbound from the chains of modesty!

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:38.200
Let your skin heat up!

00:20:38.200 --> 00:20:39.920
Let your body burst forth!

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:48.680
Take this!

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:49.800
No Guard!

00:20:49.800 --> 00:20:52.020
Attack!

00:21:02.030 --> 00:21:03.840
It's game over for me.

00:21:03.840 --> 00:21:07.280
But how could I lose to something as stupid as that?

00:21:11.470 --> 00:21:13.100
Yes!

00:21:19.350 --> 00:21:20.560
Sorry!

00:21:22.370 --> 00:21:25.400
But why am I embarrassed?

00:21:28.300 --> 00:21:31.240
The best defense is a good offense.

00:21:31.240 --> 00:21:34.770
Dropping your guard is the ultimate weapon.

00:21:35.190 --> 00:21:36.880
That's a disgusting, perverted strategy!

00:21:36.880 --> 00:21:37.940
I won't stand for it!

00:21:38.270 --> 00:21:42.820
Humans are all born naked.

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:50.720
But that strategy is a double-edged sword.

00:21:50.720 --> 00:21:55.910
In exchange for perfect senses, the
Elements sacrifice all of their defense.

00:21:57.810 --> 00:22:01.860
I think it'd be best if we all just covered up for now.

00:22:07.850 --> 00:22:10.700
How? When did you take these?

00:22:10.700 --> 00:22:12.660
Here's 500 kowloons.

00:22:12.660 --> 00:22:13.560
Thanks so much!

00:22:17.150 --> 00:22:18.580
Put me down for one!

00:22:18.580 --> 00:22:19.180
Me, too!

00:22:19.180 --> 00:22:22.300
Stop it! Don't sell any more of those!

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:24.990
Zessica.

00:22:24.990 --> 00:22:27.150
What are you doing all the way over here?

00:22:27.150 --> 00:22:29.580
Nothing! I'm not doing anything!

00:24:10.880 --> 00:24:13.680
Try saying "horrible" ten times fast.

00:24:14.680 --> 00:24:17.310
Horrible horrible horble hobble holeble hole hole...

00:24:17.930 --> 00:24:20.020
I hate holes! I'm going to fill them all!

00:24:20.470 --> 00:24:24.420
Next time on Aquarion Evol: Turn Man and Woman into a <i>Hole</i> New Word.
